        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kiwany Daudi kïngalan nko Saulö, kïchomnyö kisön pö Yonatan nko cho pö Daudi. Kicham nyinte Daudi le nyinte kegh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumït Saulö Daudi asisoni akimökïchömchïnye kïmïl katangwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwam Yonatan muma nko Daudi, ompöwölo kicham nyinte Daudi le nyinte kegh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïngwïs Yonatan sïra nyo kiloköy akutö Daudi nko sïrokachi pö poryot nko choke nko kïwanti nko angweto mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigh Daudi nyo karam ompö kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo kiyok Saulö. Kïlenyona kwigh Saulö kughyongchö pipö lïk. Kïkaramit kïyoni ompö pich nko ompö mötwori Saulö.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kepö Saulö Daudi sikong",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kimi kïpkonöy kaw, ompö wölay kipara Daudi Kolyat, kïpka koru kanastina Israel löwïr kïtarok pöytoghin Saulö. Kitumöy tumwöyi ngörekyö ompö kwïrkwïris nko kari tumwöy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Sam 21:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.29.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtum koruchay kughönöy walaka kïlentöy,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlïtyï mïkulögh nyo gha Saulö nyo kiyonu Tororöt ato le asïyechu, kutor kïngalan le chepöyï. Kïmi Daudi kïpïtöy pïkan le osis löwïr, akitïng Saulö ngot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunan Saulö lö, “Otoran nyinte kïnam nayat.” Kïtor kïnyïl odeny wölo kïghöpön Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwagh Saulö Daudi, ompöwölo kimi ECHOTYON nko nyinte, nyo kikïpïstö Saulö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïyona Saulö Daudi wölo mi nyinte akutö kïlïkwï yetïn pö pipö lïk 1,000. Kuntöghoghchï Daudi pikachi ompö poryot ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akïrïnta ompö kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo kigh, ompöwölo kimi ECHOTYON nko nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kisïwa Saulö lö kirïntoghisyö Daudi, kuwagh tya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïcham pipö Israel nko cho pö Yuda Daudi, ompöwölo ki kintöghoghin nyo karam nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kep Daudi chepö Saulö",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Saulö Daudi, “Oyilunyi poretyenyan Merap, ato ipöghisyewaninyi nyo karam aiporyenyi poryo ECHOTYON.” Kinan Saulö lö, “Mömïchininye aparan nyinte, ngwangwa kïpar Pilisti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Daudi Saulö, “Ochan ngo anta koto paponyan anta orenyi ompö Israel, nyo omukan ope chepö pöytoghin?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo otini kitïta ato kitökiyilchini Merap Daudi, keyilchï Adriel nyo ngwïno Meola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïcham chepö Saulö nyo kïkuro Mikal Daudi. Kemwochï nyinte, kïngarak Saulö ompö ngalechoni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akunan lö, “Oyilchinan nyinte, atökïlïkwï ngöghöp, atamanyïl kïpar Pilisti nyinte.” Kïlenchï Saulö Daudi nyo pö odeny, “Ipenyi ye nyu cheptönyan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Saulö pikachi, “Ongölonchinö Daudi ompö sison amwochï lö, ‘Chöminyi pöytoghintö nko mötworichi tïkwïl, kïlenyona ipö cheptanyi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmwochï mötwori Saulö Daudi ngalechoni. Kïlö Daudi, “Ononekwo so lö kïgh nyo mïnïng kep chepö pöytoghin, mosïwïyekwanye so lö ochan meywon nyo tuw, amochanye rumunote?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmwochï mötworichi Saulö ngalechay kamwa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Saulö, omwochinö Daudi lö, “Kölö pöytoghintö, ‘Momöchanye kanyoy, kïpoto roloni Pilisti cho le pokol akonga, atö atakan pungköchan.’ ” Ki machata Saulö kepara Daudi poryot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kimwochï mötwori Saulö Daudi ngalechoni, kïngarak nyoman otini kinan lö kipöy nyinte chepö pöytoghin. Kwigh lawel kïtomö kuwonyö osiswö cho kimwowï Saulö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
